  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• To a medium saucepan, add the water and bring to the boil.\n• Add basmati rice, stir, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low.\n• Cook for 10 minutes, then remove pan from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and water is absorbed, 10 minutes.\n• Stir through the butter. Cover to keep warm. TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam so don't peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f879894264524ca97a59de/step-923ede00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While rice is cooking, roughly chop Asian greens.\n• Slice zucchini into half-moons.\n• Cut plain tofu (see ingredients) into 2cm chunks."
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook zucchini, until tender, 4-5 minutes. Transfer to a bowl."
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• When the oil is hot, cook tofu, turning occasionally, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add mild North Indian spice blend and cook, turning to coat, until fragrant, 1 minute."
    },
    {
      "text": "Add mild curry paste, coconut milk, the brown sugar, Asian greens and return cooked zucchini to the pan and cook stirring, until thickened, 2-3 minutes. Season to taste."
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide rice between bowls.\n• Top with tofu and veggie korma curry.\n• Sprinkle over flaked almonds and dollop over Greek-Style yoghurt to serve. Enjoy!"
    }
  ]
